elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Guidelight评估五大AI实验室遏制能力，OpenAI以3分排名第一</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic正式向公众免费开源内部培训平台Claude Academy</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AI初创公司Hugging Face寻求出售，交易估值或达130亿美元</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴拟配售800亿港元新股，所得资金将全部投入AI基础设施建设</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d32db24ac870199f99bf2504ff9a438e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴于8月23日宣布，拟向美国境外的非美国人士配售新股，募资总额达800亿港元，这是其2019年港股上市以来首次启动新股配售，且交易已获超额认购。所得款项净额将100%用于投资全栈AI能力及加强AI基础设施建设。根据2027财年第一季度财报，阿里巴巴AI相关产品年化收入（ARR）已突破495亿元人民币，其中AI云与算力服务收入同比增长45%至484.37亿元。公司预计AI资本开支有望在2至3年内收回，并设定阿里云2030年外部商业化收入达1000亿美元、利润率超20%的目标。此次融资反映了阿里巴巴对AI算力长期需求的战略布局，旨在通过大规模资本投入巩固其在AI基础设施领域的竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动Seed部门完成组织架构调整，重构预训练、强化学习与Agent研发链路</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8cb4e67f91eb28ea66ed5002db0c70ff.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动大模型部门Seed于上周完成新一轮组织调整，Seed Foundation Model下设四个一级部门，均向吴永辉汇报。此次重构旨在整合预训练数据、强化学习及模型后训练资源，并明确B端与C端产品模型布局。具体架构为：李成刚负责Pretrain Data，统一管理多模态及超大模型预训练数据；唐晟宇负责Horizon RL，重点推进强化学习以提升模型基础智能；秦禹嘉负责Product Posttrain-Work，专注于B端办公场景的Agentic模型研发；朱文佳负责Product Posttrain-Chat，继续深耕C端对话模型。此次调整通过细化研发链路，将豆包、Dola等产品的底层能力与应用场景深度解耦，旨在通过差异化的模型体系，强化企业办公Agent与消费级对话场景的竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Guidelight评估五大AI实验室遏制能力，OpenAI以3分排名第一</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b7d8e20a3e9de72bffce73b4fc005000.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Guidelight AI Standards近日发布针对前沿AI实验室遏制能力的评估报告，考察Anthropic、Google、OpenAI、Meta和xAI在监控、异常处置、第三方审计及模型关闭等机制上的表现。在满分5分的评估中，OpenAI以3分位居榜首，Anthropic和Meta得分最低。Guidelight定义的“遏制方案”指在AI突破人类控制时，预先明确撤销权限、限制任务及下线模型的应急流程。评估指出，尽管OpenAI曾有暂停工作负载的实践，但各实验室均未公开完整的正式失控应急计划。Google与OpenAI回应称，公开评估无法覆盖其全部内部安全机制。随着AI Agent自主执行能力提升，加州SB53法案及联邦《人工智能终止开关法案》等监管要求日益强化。Guidelight首席科学家Steven</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic正式向公众免费开源内部培训平台Claude Academy</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b71cbb1ef0b58e51f834cbf694c2fb5b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic宣布将其内部新员工培训平台Claude Academy全面免费向公众开放，用户注册Claude账号即可访问。该平台包含289个学习资源，涵盖AI基础知识、Claude Code、API调用、智能体（Agents）开发及生产级系统部署等核心技术领域。课程核心基于“AI Fluency 4D”框架，旨在培养用户与AI深度协作的心智模式，而非单纯传授提示词技巧。学员完成课程后可获得官方颁发的结业徽章。此举标志着Anthropic正通过系统化教育资源，帮助开发者与职场人士提升AI协作能力，以应对大模型技术快速迭代带来的行业变革。该平台不仅是技术教学工具，更试图重构AI时代下的生产力学习逻辑。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI初创公司Hugging Face寻求出售，交易估值或达130亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/7834f7e3ba20d894d2541c7759924b6a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AI初创公司Hugging Face正探索出售事宜，目前已与银行合作评估潜在竞购者的收购兴趣，交易估值预计可达130亿美元或更高。Hugging Face总部位于纽约，是全球核心的开源大模型与数据集托管平台。回顾2023年，该公司在由Salesforce、谷歌与英伟达领投的融资中估值约为45亿美元。若此次出售最终落地，意味着其估值在不到三年内增长近三倍。这一动向反映出开源AI基础设施在当前算力与生态竞争中，已从单纯的社区资产转变为科技巨头争夺的战略级收购标的。对于行业而言，Hugging Face作为AI开发生态的枢纽，其所有权变更可能对开源模型的托管、分发及开发者社区的未来走向产生深远影响。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
